sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant X as Cancellation API / SQL
    participant C as Closing / new purchase
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    Note over X,D: Row selector: customer_billing_state.customer_id = C<br/>Request advisory identity: api_idempotency_operations.operation_scope<br/>plus api_idempotency_operations.idempotency_key (not a row lock)
    Note over X,D: One active subscription, inclusive last billed month M.<br/>Each competing operation locks the same customer account.
    alt Cancellation gets the account before closing
        X->>D: BEGIN, request lock for API<br/>FOR UPDATE<br/>customer_billing_state.customer_id = C
        C->>D: BEGIN, FOR UPDATE<br/>customer_billing_state.customer_id = C
        Note over C,D: WAIT for cancellation
        X->>D: Validate purchase, no previous cancellation<br/>No closed month at or after M
        X->>D: INSERT addon_cancellations<br/>Trigger reuses account lock, validates dates and closure
        X->>D: Advance state_version, store API result, COMMIT
        D-->>C: Account lock granted
        C->>D: Invoice M at the full subscription price, COMMIT
        Note over C,D: Months after M omit this subscription
    else Closing gets the account first
        C->>D: BEGIN, FOR UPDATE<br/>customer_billing_state.customer_id = C
        X->>D: BEGIN, request lock for API<br/>FOR UPDATE<br/>customer_billing_state.customer_id = C
        Note over X,D: WAIT for the closing transaction
        C->>D: Publish invoice M, COMMIT
        D-->>X: Account lock granted
        X->>D: Read committed closure
        X->>D: API ROLLBACK with 409 billing_conflict
        Note over X,D: Direct SQL cancellation is rejected by the trigger<br/>with SQLSTATE 23514, not an HTTP status
    end
    rect rgb(233, 247, 238)
        C->>D: New purchase command, FOR UPDATE<br/>customer_billing_state.customer_id = C<br/>Check prior immutable purchase and cancellation
        alt New start month is after M
            C->>D: INSERT a fresh subscription identity, COMMIT
        else New start month overlaps M or an active period
            C->>D: ROLLBACK, API returns 409<br/>Purchase trigger rejects overlap with SQLSTATE 23505
        end
    end
    Note over X,D: Two cancellation keys serialize on the account.<br/>Only the first can append termination.<br/>Same-key retries return the original cancellation.
